;
; How Dibber files a plot's beds in MYRA (dibber_rules.h DR7): under the
; plot (its number), each bed (its number in the plot) with its area in
; square decimetres. Dibber asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps
; a bed.
^ZXDIBBER(plot:i6, bed:i4) = area:i9!
